To: keith.holst@enron.com
Subject: Westgate Proforma-Phillip Allen.xls
Mime-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=us-ascii
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
X-From: Phillip K Allen
X-To: Keith Holst
