Dear Fellow NCL Wildflowers,
 
Please remember today; Tuesday, Jan. 15, 2002 your comment sheets are due.  You may either bring them to my home or post (mail) them to me by today.  If you choose not to return your comment sheet, then understand your  participation in the selection of the provisional class of 2002-2003  is also excluded.
My address is    5306 Pinewilde
                       Houston, TX   77066
                       281-893-5755
 
Teresa Gallagher-Bell
