TO ALL WILDFLOWERS VOTING MEMBERS,
A  recommendation has been made by the nominating committee & approved by the  board to allow a waiver for the Office of President as stated  below:
Bylaw reads:  Article X  Sec. D.  No. 4   Eligibility for the office of President
 a.  Shall have served on the Board of  Directors for at least two years.
Recommended Waiver for the year  2002-2003 Office of President
It is the recommendation of the Nominating  Committee to waive Article X Sec. D. No. 4  this year in order to slate  the  most qualified candidate for President for the year 2002-2003.   The recommendation has been approved by 
the Board as of the Board meeting  1/7/02.
This will be voted on at the upcoming Jan. 21st regular meeting  of the Wildflowers Chapter.  Any questions regarding the waiver please call  Nancy Ramsey, Pam Stone, or Claire Loria prior to the Jan. meeting.
Thank  you.beck-s/deleted_items/91.
