To all Members:
 
You all are doing a great job in filling out your comment sheets. I just  wanted to remind you how important your comments are to membership. As you see  there are 35 prospective member on the comment sheet, but you may not have been  aware of the additional 9 legacies. I want to remind you that the 9  Legacies are already a part of next year 7th grade Provisional Class. These  mothers and daughters are as follows:
 
Mother                                          Daughter
 
Bauer,  Gina                                   Mary  Kate
Beindorff,  Sheila                              Hayley
Christy,  Linda                                Katie
Day,  Cynthia                                  Stephanie
DuFrene,  Lynette                            Adelle
Lindsey,  Barbara                            Megan
Molohon,  Nora                               Jessi
Montalvo,  Meg                                Michelle
Munn,  Mary                                    Melissa
 
Sincerely,
 
Teresa Gallagher-Bellbenson-r/inbox/62.
